OL,3,AThree children and teacher killed in US
OL,4,Aprimary school shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 16-year-old has shot dead three
OL,7,Fchildren and a teacher at a primary
OL,8,Fschool in the US state of Oregon before
OL,9,Fhe was killed by a bystander, police
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FThe suspect, who has not been named,
OL,13,Fforced his way into Silver Rail
OL,14,FElementary School in the city of Bend
OL,15,Fon Thursday afternoon by shooting at
OL,16,Flocked doors, Bend Police Chief Mike
OL,17,FKrantz said.
OL,19,FThe teenager was shot dead by a
OL,20,Fcommunity member who "pursued him into
OL,21,Fthe school and engaged him", Krantz
OL,22,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
