OL,3,AThree children and teacher killed in US
OL,4,Aprimary school shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe three children killed were aged
OL,7,Ffive, eight and 11. A seven-year-old
OL,8,Fand a 54-year-old teacher were taken to
OL,9,Fa hospital in a critical condition,
OL,10,FKrantz said. It is unclear if the
OL,11,Fattacker had any links to the school.
